From fb855fa0807e318fa9746fd1895aceaf76b35580 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 23:05:05 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] feat(web): adopt MarkInsight design system across the web
 app
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Port MarkInsight tokens (blue-led palette, semantic colours, motion) into globals.css
- Load Noto Sans HK + Source Serif 4 via next/font; flat white surfaces, light borders
- New MarkInsight-style header (serif brand, 繁 | EN locale links, text sign-out)
- Landing hero + centred light login page with staggered fade-up motion
- StatusBadge with job-pulse, hue-tinted topic chips, semantic notices, stat tones
- Restyle documents, chat, status, settings and sources drawer to the new system
